</td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((uia))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-3a1ae716-d1b3-4851-a273-1231dcb828b2" endid="#m-a034f353-bb9d-4192-8fd9-95cf7a9ec532" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((inter abrupta)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((intellus aruptat))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-cf4ff303-663c-4c62-8e38-6f33103ddd34" endid="#m-cf4ff303-663c-4c62-8e38-6f33103ddd34"><table><tr><td><rend>((Hac))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((Ac))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-e03f5201-7c5b-4887-9b59-53595f1b5881" endid="#m-60c83350-ed1a-4fe0-b593-617b9a5b2d06" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((radiat)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((radiant))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-3732fe90-43b6-4cf8-88aa-f0804656d47e" endid="#m-3e1c8e46-72be-42aa-9689-ee23be7810eb" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((Gemme)) (wie ((Apt 17-232-1)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((Gemmas))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ff19ecae-bd19-4f8d-a14a-448fa4d3c076" endid="#m-146b1413-4fb6-4ac7-9486-5733a45f715c" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((uota)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((uote))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-a7699520-fcb1-4c46-9ac8-588e2a2e0684" endid="#m-2f4db9a7-9971-4d04-a5d0-6d275bcaae8c" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((illa)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((illi))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-40cf0abb-923e-483d-8000-3406b4e420bb" endid="#m-39c038e3-cfc8-4da0-8ad8-681d50630909" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((talia fatur))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((tali affatur))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-40cf0abb-923e-483d-8000-3406b4e420bb" endid="#m-93144e20-3cb7-461b-b514-72f567992201"><table><tr><td><rend>((†talia fatur gaudia†))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Dieser mit 2b übereinstimmende Satz ist hier unverständlich. In ((Pa 1118, Pa 1084, Apt 18, Pst 121)) ist er praktisch einheitlich überliefert, die Lesart ((tecum cęlica gaudia)) in ((Apt 17-232-1)) passt inhaltlich, ist aber mit großer Wahrscheinlichkeit eine Konjektur. Der andere Überlieferungszweig mit ((Pa 887, Ben 34, 35, 39)) enthält diese Stelle gar nicht.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>Zur Melodie vgl. ((Apt 17-232-1)), ((Pst 121-54v-9)), ((Pa 887)) und andere Fassungen der Melodie ((Iustus ut palma maior)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1118"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1118</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 1118-205-9</identifier><title>Nativitas praecursoris</title><incip><incipText><p>Nativitas praecursoris</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="205">f. 205, l. 9</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 7, 141</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Sequenz</term><term type="genre">Textiert</term><term type="feast">Iohannes Baptista</term><term type="Editor">Andreas Pfisterer</term><term type="Endseite">206</term><term type="Endzeile">1</term><term type="Melodie_Standard">Iustus ut palma maior</term><term type="Zusatz_zu_Textinitium">Ohne Notation</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1118</identifier><identifier type="cantus">Pa 1118</identifier><titleStmt><title>Pa 1118</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Tavèrnoles (möglicherweise)</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen aquitanischer Herkunft</geogName><corpName role="origin-institution">Abtei Sant Sadurní</corpName><date>10. Jh. 4. Viertel<